Decide only whether the current Intent needs a plan of child Intents.

[CURRENT INTENT]
{{#intent}}
{{^@plan_item}}

Return JSON only.
When the Intent contains at least two distinct operations, dependent steps, or independent targets, return {"result":"plan","payload":{"reason":"...","subintents":["...","..."]}}.
Otherwise return {"result":"reject","payload":{"reason":"..."}} so the Intent can be attempted with one ordinary tool call.
Starting a process and later waiting for or reading its output are dependent steps and must use a plan.
